[ ] add \< predecessor flag to add action / update action $neither add action nor update action can author a < predecessor; the DSL supports < <ref> (parser.rs) but no flag sets it, so every cross-action and cross-charter dependency needs a hand-edit. Found while wiring the identity charter dependencies in the platform workspace; sibling to the --sequential/--context gap.$ !3 #019f6ec5-481d-7b40-b0ec-ed2bbc507997
[ ] Insert --parent children after their parent's descendant block $add action --parent currently appends the new line at EOF; because DSL parentage is structural, children for earlier roots rebind under the final root after reparse. Insert adjacent to the resolved parent subtree and add a multi-root regression test.$ !1 +bug #019f733f-fe3e-74c0-b6b2-cdf7618572c1
